Parameter Type Presence Description <code>lang</code> <code>string</code> REQUIRED Two-letter language code (ISO 639-1 style). <code>legalBasis</code> <code>string</code> REQUIRED Legal basis text establishing the legal person (or requiring/recommending access to a claim). Example: WRP Object for a Relying Party <p>A bank registered as a service provider (requesting PID for KYC).</p> <p> <pre><code>{
