}
</code></pre></p> Example: WRP Object for a Relying Party that is also an Attestation Provider <p>A bank registered as both a service provider (requesting 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:24878c56c54613b40268dc8f8a6595b6: for KYC) and a <code>QEAA_Provider</code> (issuing bank account attestations to wallet units). It has both <code>intendedUse</code> and <code>providesAttestations</code>. <p> <pre><code>{
  "legalPerson": {
    "legalName": ["ExampleBank S.A."]
  },
  "identifier": [
    {
      "type": "http://data.europa.eu/eudi/id/EUID",
