</code></pre></p> Example: WRP Object for a Designated Intermediary <p>An entity registered as a designated Intermediary that acts on behalf of 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:779ea2759051abf63b6b853e5399db46: during Wallet interactions. It has <code>isIntermediary: true</code> and does not declare <code>intendedUse</code> (not required when registering solely as an intermediary). <p> <pre><code>{
  "legalPerson": {
