</code></pre></p> Example: WRP Object for a WRP Using a Designated Intermediary <p>A small e-commerce business that relies on TrustBridge (see example above) to conduct Wallet interactions on its behalf. It has <code>usesIntermediary</code> pointing to the Intermediary's registry entry, and <code>isIntermediary: false</code>.</p> <p> <pre><code>{
