Attribute Type Presence Description Reference <code>intermediary</code> <code>object</code> CONDITIONAL Used when the 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:7c1cc7e8580080d6ae2c2a89a47d06ca: operates via an 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:ddc4ebced81ee7db45103ef43c1ca50d:.REQUIRED IF: Intermediary is used. [ETSI TS 119 475, Table 10] - <code>usesIntermediary</code> <code>intermediary.sub</code> <code>string</code> CONDITIONAL Identifier of the 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:106535b79efb691bafe03abbe7cb1e6e: as specified by the 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:f1a576c5ed986ddebd00467165070421: 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:fe208dd7ed1b55e6f62e0cbfebf9c9a1:.REQUIRED IF: 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:27536956b0b43f3f1a67209774c82f03: is used. [ETSI TS 119 475, Table 10] - <code>usesIntermediary</code> <code>intermediary.sname</code> <code>string</code> CONDITIONAL Common name of the 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:0950b4b97941f6ae9886c499ada53f07: as specified by the 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:2193396fba569fe449a11f63071ad48d: 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:fd1475c2b0d28f7ebd06a0aec7322a8f:.REQUIRED IF: 6251a85a-47d0-11ee-be56-0242ac120002:6346b5ed2a49bfdc96bf782e2cdf079b: is used. [ETSI TS 119 475, Table 10] - <code>usesIntermediary</code> <p>Intermediary Identifier Format</p> <p>Regarding the format of the <code>intermediary.sub</code> field, refer to the "Organizational Identifiers" note in Core Identity Attributes.</p> <p>CWT Claims</p> <p>CWT claims SHALL be registered in the following register by IANA: https://www.iana.org/assignments/cwt/cwt.xhtml.</p> Example: JWT Header <p> <pre><code>{
  "typ": "rc-wrp+jwt",
  "alg": "ES256",
  "x5c": ["&lt;base64-encoded-certificate-chain&gt;"]
}
</code></pre></p> Example: CWT Header <p> <pre><code>{
  1: -7,    / alg: ES256 /,
  16: "rc-wrp+cwt", / typ /
  33: [     / x5chain /
    h'...', / binary end cert /
    h'...', / binary intermediate cert /
    h'...'  / binary root cert /
  ]
}
</code></pre></p> Example: JWT Payload - Service Provider <p> <pre><code>{
